	"TagLine": "Catch critters with a net.",
	"Description": "**Bug Net** lets you catch critters with a net.\n\n**Install**\n\n1.  Install the latest version of [SMAPI](https://smapi.io) and [SpaceCore](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1348) .\n\n2.  Unzip the mod folder into [font=Courier New]Stardew Valley/Mods[/font].\n\n3.  Run the game using SMAPI.\n**Use**\nBuy the bug net from Pierre's shop for 500g, hold it like any other tool, and swing it to catch critters.\n\n**Compatibility**\nCompatible with Stardew Valley 1.5.5+ on Linux/macOS/Windows, both single-player and multiplayer.\n\n**See also**\n\n*   [Release notes](https://github.com/spacechase0/StardewValleyMods/blob/develop/BugNet/docs/release-notes.md#release-notes)\n\n*   [Source code](https://github.com/spacechase0/StardewValleyMods)",
